From: Ali Asiri <assiri@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:50:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] i18n(desktop): restore Arabic to full coverage on current main

Bring apps/desktop/src/i18n/ar.ts back to 100% key parity with en.ts.

Measured on NousResearch/hermes-agent@6178e9f4 (2026-09-07): main Arabic
supplied 2423 of 3354 English leaves (~72%). The August catch-up PR
(#92651) still has 759 of those translations, but it now conflicts with
main and is missing the UI shipped since 23 Aug — local models, managed
SSH updates, real-browser-profile browsing, fleet profiles, preview
annotations, and status-bar resource meters.

This file is the union of:
- current main Arabic (newer keys such as sessionImport)
- #92651 Arabic (the 759-key catch-up)
- 170 new translations for UI that landed after that PR

No previously translated string on main is rewritten except where a key
moved with the English catalogue. Stale keys English no longer has are
dropped so the locale matches the current type.

Placeholders, function signatures, and {name}/{count} tokens are
preserved. Product names stay in Latin script (Hermes, llama.cpp, GPU,
Hugging Face, SSH, MCP).

